    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "AsciiDoc provides the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "footnote"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " macro for adding footnotes to your document. A footnote is a reference to an item in a footnote list. The footnote is defined in AsciiDoc at the location of the reference, but the text is extracted to an item in the footnote list. You can refer to the same footnote in multiple locations by assigning an ID to the first occurrence and referencing that ID in subsequent occurrences."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "All AsciiDoc processors, including Asciidoctor, currently implement footnotes as endnotes. The placement and numbering of footnotes can be customized using a custom converter."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "note"
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can insert footnotes into your document using the footnote macro. The text of the footnote is defined between the square brackets of the footnote macro ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "footnote:[text]"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). The footnote macro accepts an optional ID using the target of the macro ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "footnote:id[text]"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). Specifying an ID allows you to refer to that same footnote from multiple locations in the document. To make a reference to a previously defined footnote, you specify the ID in the target without specifying text ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "footnote:id[]"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ")."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-footnote",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The hail-and-rainbow protocol can be initiated at five levels:\n\n. doublefootnote:[The double hail-and-rainbow level makes my toes tingle.] "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO1-1",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "1",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO1-2",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "2",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\n. tertiary\n. supernumerary\n. supermassive\n. apocalyptic\n\nA bold statement!footnote:disclaimer[Opinions are my own.] "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO1-3",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "3",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\n\nAnother outrageous statement.footnote:disclaimer[] "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO1-4",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "4",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Footnote syntax"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "colist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO1-1"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Insert the footnote macro directly after any punctuation. Note that the footnote macro only uses a single colon ("
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": ":"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ")."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO1-2"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Insert the footnote’s content within the square brackets ("
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "[]"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "). The text may span several lines."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO1-3"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "If you plan to reuse a footnote, specify a unique ID in the target position."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO1-4"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "To reference an existing footnote, you only need to specify the ID of the footnote in the target slot. The text between the square brackets should be empty. If both the ID and text are specified, and the ID has already been defined by an earlier footnote, the text is ignored."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": "arabic",
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you find that having to put the footnote macro directly adjacent to a word makes it difficult to read, you can insert an attribute reference in between that resolves to an empty string (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "word{empty}footnote:[text]"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ")."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "tip"
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The footnotes are numbered consecutively throughout the article."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The results of "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Example 1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#ex-footnote"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " are displayed below."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
